dried fruit|link|fndds:2709195|same||USDA FNDDS "Dried fruit, NFS" is USDA's own generic record (raisins 299, dried cranberries 308, apricots 241, dates 282 around it); the recipes list raisins, cranberries, apricots or dates|
fruit juice|link|fndds:2709315|same||USDA FNDDS "Fruit juice, NFS" is USDA's own generic record (orange 45, apple 46, grape 61 around it)|
