italian seasoning|gap||||owner decision wave 14: a blend with no trusted record stays a named gap (11 FDC labels run 32 to 429 kcal per 100 g)|
dijon mustard|gap|fndds:2710085|||owner decision wave 14: stays a gap unless a trusted record exists; labels round to 0 g, USDA generic mustard is 69 kcal and prepared yellow mustard 61, which is a different mustard|
